!docs/users/**

# Translation catalogs. The distribution activates only English and French
# (custom-addons/usl_locale), so only the .pot templates and the en*, fr and
# fr_* catalogs enter the image. Odoo reads <module>/i18n/<lang>.po and
# <module>/i18n_extra/<lang>.po when a language is activated; a language
# without a catalog stays untranslated until the image is rebuilt with its
# .po files.
**/i18n/*.po
!**/i18n/en*.po
!**/i18n/fr.po
!**/i18n/fr_*.po
**/i18n_extra/*.po
!**/i18n_extra/en*.po
!**/i18n_extra/fr.po
!**/i18n_extra/fr_*.po

# usl_bootstrap is a test-only fixture. Keep this rule last so that no later
# exception adds one of its files back.
custom-addons/usl_bootstrap/
